CeladonCity_Interior8_Text_PokeManiac_1::
	.string "Let me recount a terryfing tale...\p"
	.string "Once upon a time, there was a little\n"
	.string "boy who was given a new BICYCLE...\p"
	.string "He wanted to try it right away...\p"
	.string "He was having so much fun that he\n"
	.string "didn’t notice the sun had set...\p"
	.string "While riding home in the pitch-black\n"
	.string "night, the bike suddenly slowed!\p"
	.string "The pedals became heavy!\p"
	.string "When he stopped pedaling, the bike\n"
	.string "began slipping backwards!\p"
	.string "It was as if the bike were cursed\n"
	.string "and trying to drag him into oblivion!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "...$"

CeladonCity_Interior8_Text_PokeManiac_2::
	.string "SHRIEEEEK!\p"
	.string "The boy had been riding uphill on\n"
	.string "CYCLING ROAD!\p"
	.string "...\n"
	.string "Ba-dum ba-dum!\p"
	.string "For listening so patiently, you may\n"
	.string "take this--TM03!$"

CeladonCity_Interior8_Text_PokeManiac_3::
	.string "TM03 is CURSE.\p"
	.string "It’s a terryfing move that slowly\n"
	.string "whittles down the victim’s HP.$"
